plans/index-system-HANDOFF-2026-07-28.md:347:Do **not** size-optimise: `data/corpus` holds two relative symlinks (`compiled-index.json -> compiled-index.v2.json`, `ontology-embeddings.jsonl -> ontology-embeddings.v1.jsonl`); excluding the large derived artifacts drops the archive to 1.8 MB and leaves both dangling. Do **not** use `tar -h` — it doubles the archive. Verifying at the source proves nothing.
